'''Buzzshock''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Nosedeenian (Classic)|Nosedeenian]]{{Refn|The name [[Nosedeenian]] comes from '''Nosedeen Quasar''', which is a misspelling of [[Nosideen]] quasar, the home place for the species as revealed in [[Pop-Up Trivia|pop-up trivia]] for ''[[Ben 10,000 (Episode)|Ben 10,000]]''.{{Refn|[[:File:Nosideen Quasar Proof.png]]|group = pop-up|name=quasar}} On October 18, 2009, the Nosedeen Quasar page was created by user [[User:The Ultimate Necrofriggian|The Ultimate Necrofriggian]], with the spelling error being neglected for years. Eventually, in the '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' episode ''[[A Jolt From the Past]]'' the species was referred to as Nosedeenians, thereby canonizing the name with a misspelling.{{Refn|[[Ben 10 Planet:Longstanding Misinformation]]|group = BTP}}|group = note}} from the [[Nosideen]] quasar.{{Refn|group = pop-up|name = quasar}}<ref name="B10k">''[[Ben 10,000 (Episode)|Ben 10,000]]''</ref>

==Appearance==
===Ben 10,000 as Buzzshock===
Buzzshock's appearance is similar to an [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]] dry cell battery, albeit rounded out. He is black with green eyes, a large lightning bolt-like stripe spanning from his neck starts to his waist on his front and back sides, and positive (+) and negative (-) symbols on his back.

In the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''', Buzzshock's lightning bolt stripe was white, he had a hole on his head that could release electricity. The [[Omnitrix (Original Future)|Omnitrix]] symbol is located on his chest.

===Ben as Buzzshock===
In the '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''' [[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)/Theme Song|intro]], Buzzshock looked mostly the same as he did in the '''Original Series''', except the hole on his head was filled in with a flat grey spot and his [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol was recolored green.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Buzzshock has two bolts on each arm, the lightning bolt stripe is recolored green, and the top of his head features a proper battery cap, colored light green. His head is now more prominent, as his chin actually sticks out rather than being a part of a long, one-piece body, and his eyes are now almond-shaped instead of being circular. He wears the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on the top of his head cap.

===Ken as Buzzshock===
[[Ken Tennyson (Original)|Ken]]'s Buzzshock looked the same as [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]]'s Buzzshock in the '''Original Series'''.

===Bad Ben as Bad Buzzshock===
[[Bad Ben]] as Buzzshock looks identical to [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Prime]]'s Buzzshock in '''Omniverse''', save for all the green parts being recolored mint green.

